 This install applies to "Robinson's Requiem" © Silmarils.

 This install requires WHDLoad to be in the path. It can be found in the
 WHDLoad package.

 The installed program requires 1.0 MB ChipMem and 0.8 MB OtherMem for ECS version
                            and 1.7 MB ChipMem and 1.5 MB OtherMem for AGA version
 (AGA with the tooltype MemConfig=1: 1.7 MB ChipMem and 0.8 MB OtherMem)

 It can be quit by pressing F10 (key can be changed with Tooltype "QuitKey=").

 The ECS game requires an installed A500 Kickstart 1.3 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick34005.A500". The image can be extracted from a A500 with
 tools like 'GrabKick' or similar which can be found on aminet.
 If the image is of wrong version or altered in any way WHDLoad will quit with
 an appropriate message.
 Additionally the file "kick34005.A500.RTB" must be installed in the same
 directory as the kickstart image. It can be found in the archive
 "util/boot/skick345.lha" on aminet.

 The AGA game requires an installed A1200/A4000 Kickstart 3.1 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick40068.A1200" or "kick40068.A4000". The image can be
 extracted from a A1200/A4000 with tools like 'GrabKick' or similar which can
 be found on aminet.
 If the image is of wrong version or altered in any way WHDLoad will quit with
 an appropriate message.
 Additionally the file "kick40068.A1200.RTB" or "kick40068.A4000.RTB" must be
 installed in the same directory as the kickstart image. It can be found in
 the archive "util/boot/skick345.lha" on aminet.

 If you have problems with this installation please try and get a newer
 version of this package from the WHDLoad WWW-Page. If that doesn't help try
 some Tooltypes like NOCACHE, NOAUTOVEC, EXPCHIP, NOMMU, PAL or NTSC. If
 that also fails, please inform the author via the Bug-Report-Form which
 can be accessed on the WHDLoad WWW-Page.

 For the full WHDLoad package, other installs and updates refer to:
        http://www.whdload.de/
 or     aminet:dev/misc/whdload#?
 and    aminet:game/patch/

 version 2.0b (14.11.2026) done by Vesuri (AGA):
 - Uses 1 MB of Fast memory for the game's objects (WHDLoad 20 or newer); with
   the tooltype MemConfig=1 it runs in 256 KB of Fast memory as version 1.2 did
 - The CPU caches are on also without WHDLoad's MMU (68030)
 - The 3D view's buffers are in Fast memory
 - Faster chunky-to-planar conversion, based on Mikael Kalms' c2p1x1_8_c5_030_2
 - Faster sky drawing
 - Walking, the 3D view keeps the game's own pace: a new frame every 8 fields
   (6.25 per second on PAL) instead of every 9 to 12

 version 1.2 (29.03.13) done by CFou!:
 - First two bitplanes memory allocation fixed for fast memory support (AGA)
 - Speed problem fixed on ECS version
 - Fast memory used to increase speed (AGA/ECS)
 - source codes included

 version 1.1 (15.02.04) done by CFou!:
 - Little bug fixed

 version 1.0 (07.02.04) done by CFou!:
 - initial release
 - ECS and AGA Version supported
 - Manual protection removed (i hope)
 - Exotica and CFou! icons added

